---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}/></head><body><Header/>
<main class="home">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> INVESTMENT LOANS</div><h1>Finance your next investment.<em> Move with confidence.</em></h1><p class="lead">Real estate investors need financing that understands the investment. broker pal helps make the DSCR loan process clearer, more responsive, and focused on your next move.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/apply">Start a Loan Inquiry <span>↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a></div><div class="hero-note">Purchase · Rate & Term Refinance · Cash-Out Refinance</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="art-label">INVESTOR-FOCUSED FINANCING</div><div class="building"><div class="sun"></div><div class="tower t1"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="tower t2"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="house"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="ground"></div></div><div class="art-caption"><b>Built around the property.</b><span>Focused on the investor.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="report-promo"><div class="report-promo-inner"><div class="report-promo-copy"><div class="report-promo-kicker">FREE PROPERTY REPORT</div><h2>Know more before you make an offer.</h2><p>Create your own property report with an estimated value, available comparable properties, and useful property research. Then save or print your report as a PDF and move forward with more confidence.</p><a class="report-promo-button" href="/tools/property-report">Create My Free Property Report <span>↗</span></a><small>Free to use · No obligation · Property research, not an appraisal</small></div><div class="report-promo-mark" aria-hidden="true"><div class="report-sheet"><span>PROPERTY REPORT</span><b>PROPERTY<br/>AT A GLANCE</b><i></i><i></i><i></i><strong>PDF</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="trust"><div><b>01</b><span>Investor-minded<br/>loan guidance</span></div><div><b>02</b><span>Clear next steps<br/>and communication</span></div><div><b>03</b><span>Financing options for<br/>rental properties</span></div></section>
<section class="intro"><div class="section-kicker">A BETTER WAY TO MOVE FORWARD</div><h2>Your investment strategy deserves a lending partner who gets it.</h2><p>Whether you're acquiring your next rental or refinancing a property already in your portfolio, we help you navigate the DSCR financing process with practical guidance and a personal point of contact.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Get to know broker pal <span>→</span></a></section>
<section class="programs"><div class="section-kicker">FINANCING BUILT FOR INVESTORS</div><h2>Investment loan programs</h2><p class="program-intro">Explore financing paths for income-producing properties and business-purpose real estate projects.</p><div class="program-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>DSCR Rental Loans</h3><p>Financing options for rental properties with a focus on property cash flow and rental income.</p><a href="/apply">Discuss a rental loan ↗</a></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Fix &amp; Flip</h3><p>Business-purpose financing options for eligible renovation and resale projects.</p><a href="/apply">Discuss a project ↗</a></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Commercial &amp; Business Purpose</h3><p>Explore financing for qualifying investment and commercial real estate needs.</p><a href="/apply">Start a conversation ↗</a></article></div></section>
<section class="steps"><div><div class="section-kicker">SIMPLE. DIRECT. INVESTOR-FOCUSED.</div><h2>From first conversation to closing.</h2></div><div class="step-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Tell us about the property</h3><p>Share the basics of your investment and financing goals.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Review your options</h3><p>We help identify a path that fits the property and your objectives.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Move toward closing</h3><p>Stay informed on next steps as your loan moves through the process.</p></article></div><a class="button primary" href="/how-it-works">Explore the process <span>↗</span></a></section>
<section class="toolkit"><div class="section-kicker">BROKER PAL INVESTOR TOOLKIT</div><h2>Make the next move with better information.</h2><p>Free tools to evaluate a property, understand a DSCR scenario, and compare financing options.</p><div class="toolkit-grid"><a href="/tools/dscr-calculator"><b>DSCR Calculator</b><span>Estimate coverage, NOI and cash flow ↗</span></a><a href="/tools/loan-comparison"><b>Loan Comparison</b><span>Compare rate, costs, down payment and prepayment ↗</span></a><a href="/tools/property-report"><b>Property Data Report</b><span>Build a printable property worksheet and research public records ↗</span></a><a href="/community"><b>Opportunity Circle</b><span>Meet the people behind the investment ↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="closing"><div><div class="section-kicker">READY FOR YOUR NEXT INVESTMENT?</div><h2>Let's talk about your next property.</h2><p>Start with a quick inquiry. We'll connect with you about the property and financing you're considering.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/apply">Get Started <span>↗</span></a></section>
</main><Footer/></body></html>
<style>
